WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.088
Draw a flat shape with 3 corners. Let us think carefully. Count edges and vertices or

00:00:06.088 --> 00:00:10.504
look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is triangle. Great work!

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:17.303
Draw a flat shape with 5 sides. Let us think carefully. Count edges and vertices or

00:00:17.303 --> 00:00:21.756
look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is pentagon. Great work!

00:00:22.617 --> 00:00:28.456
Draw a flat shape with 6 sides. Let us think carefully. Count edges and vertices or

00:00:28.456 --> 00:00:32.835
look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is hexagon. Great work!

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:39.340
What is the flat face of a cube? Let us think carefully. Count edges and vertices or

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:43.321
look at the three-dimensional shape’s faces. The answer is square. Great work!
